# Audit fix (Section 4 "Release signing" / Section 13 #7)
#
# Yeh file sirf ek TEMPLATE hai (real secrets nahi) — isliye committed
# hai. Real signing ke liye:
#
#   1. Apna keystore banao (ek hi baar, phir hamesha ke liye safe jagah
#      rakho — kho gaya to app future updates ke liye kabhi upload nahi
#      ho paayegi, Play Store naya app hi samjhega):
#
#        keytool -genkey -v -keystore release.jks \
#          -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 10000 -alias upload
#
#   2. Is file ko copy karo `android/app/key.properties` naam se (bina
#      `.example` ke) — woh naam is repo ke root `.gitignore` mein
#      already excluded hai, kabhi commit nahi hoga.
#
#   3. Neeche ke 4 values apni real details se bharo. `storeFile` yahan
#      `android/app/` ke RELATIVE path hai (ya absolute path bhi chal
#      jaayega).
#
# storeFile=release.jks
# storePassword=CHANGE_ME
# keyAlias=upload
# keyPassword=CHANGE_ME
